This repository is published for the sole purpose of allowing TECHNICAL
EVALUATION of the author's work by employers, prospective clients and
collaborators. The source code is visible, but it is NOT open source software.

YOU MAY:
  - Read, inspect and review the code for evaluation purposes.
  - Reference it during a hiring or technical review process.

YOU MAY NOT, without the author's prior written permission:
  - Use the code, in whole or in part, in any project or product.
  - Copy, reproduce, modify or create derivative works.
  - Distribute, sublicense, sell or commercially exploit the software.
  - Deploy it or offer it as a service to third parties.
  - Use the code or its contents to train machine learning models or
    artificial intelligence systems.

The absence of an open source license is intentional. Nothing in this
repository shall be construed as granting rights under the MIT, Apache, GPL or
any other free software license.

To request usage permissions, contact the author.

